"Salesforce, HubSpot, Zendesk, Mews, Cloudbeds, un formulaire Google, "
"n'importe quoi — directement vers SwissReply.AI, sans aucun code."

msgid ""
"In Zapier or Make, pick the trigger app you want to pull reviews from (e.g. "
"\"New Ticket in Zendesk\", \"New Row in Google Sheets\")."
